ncz-screensavers (0.7.11) unstable; urgency=medium

  * launcher: legacy tier names ("igpu", "discrete") survive a custom tiers argument; offload
    honours a synthetic nvidia target when gpu_topology says offload is possible but list_gpus()
    is empty (degraded sysfs, test envs); render_env stops forcing NCZ_RENDER_SCALE=0.5 on hosts
    where the "weak" class is only a topology-table guess; Supervisor publishes the picked hack
    in state.json before the child launch so a parent that observes the supervisor pid also
    sees the hack; <hack> --dump-schema timeout drops from 5 s to 1 s; system_class trusts a
    cached measurement over the gpu_topology display-class fallback so seeded test entries
    and real benchmarks both win.
  * Report a class for each detected GPU and explain PRIME render offload in
    the launcher, GTK settings, and Singularity plugin.
  * Classify the Sky1 Mali-G720 from its renderer and discard cache scores
    measured on a different GPU.

 -- Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 16:25:00 -0400

ncz-screensavers (0.7.10) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Neutral catalog ids: hyprsaver_matrix/stonks/tesla become hyprsaver_digitalrain/ticker/arccoil
    (Digital Rain, Ticker, Arc Coil) and gibson becomes datatowers (Data Towers). Stored hack-id,
